      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode closed with an executable plan for continuing prescribed medicines, tracking symptoms, and escalating for major cardiopulmonary red flags, and the caregiver demonstrated understanding. Closure remained incomplete because self-harm/harm screening and allergy-disclosure/allergy safety-net duties were not fully carried forward.",
